363:''R-CHARTER, the one AID train.'' Its first stage stands landed (train K of #/the-trains): the chairs sign with seat keys of their own and pre-rotate on cold cards, a Nexus answers to `nexus-<sha>`, the floor key commits no next key, per-Nexus keys mint at random, the PersonaGroup stands as a Keyhive group, and the Stable founding act founds a hearth (`lares vessel found --hearth`): the place, persona zero and a PRIVATE seed charter at one seat, with no keyring, every fleet relation bound to that charter's AID, and every harness that founds a hearth founding through it (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/founding-runbook#/found">>). What stays owed:
